#
# Counter-example for gmeow:ConceptTenureShape: a ConceptTenure with NO
# gmeow:duringInterval. gmeow:duringInterval has sh:minCount 1, so validation MUST
# emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (and no other finding).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecTenureMissingInterval).
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/cnc/> .

ex:mammal a gmeow:Concept .

ex:tenure2 a gmeow:ConceptTenure ;
    gmeow:conceptHoldsFor ex:mammal .
